      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOT IMMUNITY (3) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 3 lengths at Warragul in a handy 23.39 beating Mt. View Rupee. Ideally placed to take this out. FERNANDO SUCRE (6) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Special Sian (20.37) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Bold showing expected. JACK HOOK (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (25.27) in a Grade 5 at Sale. Cannot be taken lightly. JUMBUK JOZEF (7) cannot be left out over a shorter distance.",
